OCPARTICLE 2
NAME Spark Trails
# Wave 10 demo: every spark drags a 12-point ribbon behind it (trail ribbons), bounces off the world plane z = 0
# (restitution 0.45; collision planes are in WORLD space, so the level's floor wants to sit at z = 0) and cools from white-yellow to red.
EMITTER Sparks
SIM auto
SHAPE sphere 10
BLEND additive
EMISSION 90 120 4096
LIFETIME 1.2 2.4
DIRECTION 0 0 1 70
SPEED 350 750
GRAVITY 0 0 -980
DAMPING 0.02
SIZE 3 1.2
COLORCURVE 0 1 0.95 0.7 1 0.3 1 0.5 0.15 0.9 1 0.2 0.04 0.01 0
RENDER ribbon trail 12 6 fade 1
SORT none
LIGHTING unlit
FOG on
BOUNDS 1800
MODULE update.collideplane nx=0 ny=0 nz=1 d=0 restitution=0.45 friction=0.3 kill=0
